ok    CPU virtualization    on in firmware
FAIL  Hypervisor            Windows Hypervisor Platform is on, but the hypervisor isn't running
      impact: Puddle can't start any workspace: the Windows hypervisor isn't running.
      remedy: Restart Windows. If it still doesn't run, run `bcdedit /set hypervisorlaunchtype
              auto` as administrator and restart.
